    <panel_attributes>title=SD01 - Generate Weekly Meal Plan   (UC04; F01, F03, F05, F06, F11, F12)\nThe page calls the facade in-process on a background worker; the CLI (PlanCommand) and the assistant call the same operation
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:PlanView\n«JavaFX page»~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:PlanningStrategyFactory~SF
obj=strategy:\nPlanningStrategy~ST
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:RecipeTool~RT
obj=:PromptBuilder~PB
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=:OpenAIClient\n«external»~EXT
obj=:PortionService~POR
obj=:ProposalValidator~PV
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV
obj=:NutritionService~NS
obj=:BudgetService~BS
obj=:MealPlanService~MPS
obj=:MealPlanRepository~MPR

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: Generate plan (start date,\ndays, focus, note)
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: generateWeeklyPlan(\nrequest); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 3: generateWeeklyPlan(\nrequest); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 4:\nbuildContext(\nrequest)
tick=1
combinedFragment=loop~L AC BS; AG:[attempt &lt;= 2 and proposal not yet valid]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 5: createPlanProposal(\ncontext); on=AG
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF : 6: strategyFor(context); on=SF
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF + : 7:\ncreateStrategy(\nmode)
tick=1
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 8: configure(profile)
SF.&gt;AG : 9: NutritionGoal / Budget /\nTimeAware strategy; off=SF
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 10: describeTools(); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 11: recipeSearch, nutritionAnalysis, groceryList, substituteIngredient; off=TM
combinedFragment=loop~T AG EXT; SF:[step &lt;= maxToolSteps and the LLM has not chosen "finish"]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 12: buildToolSelectionPrompt(context, goal, filters, ...); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 13: prompt; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 14: generateStructured(prompt, next_action schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM-&gt;&gt;&gt;EXT : 15: responses().create(\nparams); on=EXT
EXT.&gt;LLM : 16: strict JSON answer; off=EXT
LLM.&gt;AG : 17: next action: call_tool or finish; off=LLM
combinedFragment=alt~D AG EXT; SF:[valid tool call, e.g. recipeSearch]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 18: isValidCall(toolName, args); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 19: true; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 20: execute(toolName, args, context); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT : 21: execute(args, context); on=RT
RT-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT + : 22:\nsearchRecipes(\nquery)
tick=1
RT.&gt;TM : 23: ToolResult(candidates, summary); off=RT
TM.&gt;AG : 24: ToolResult (recorded as a ToolCall); off=TM
..=D; SF:[unknown tool or invalid arguments]
text=AG:not executed, callProblems()\nare returned to the LLM as\nthe next observation
..=D; SF:["finish"]
text=AG:tool phase ends
--=D
--=T
combinedFragment=opt~O AG RT; SF:[fewer than 8 candidates for a meal type, or too few that fit a day's time limit]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 25: execute("recipeSearch", (mealType, maxMinutes), context); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 26: ToolResult (broad or time-limited search added by the agent); off=TM
--=O
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 27: rank(candidates, context); on=ST
ST.&gt;AG : 28: top 8 per meal type, plus quick ones for each time limit; off=ST
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 29: buildPlanningPrompt(context, candidates, ...); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 30: prompt with per-day lists of candidates that fit; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 31: generateStructured(prompt, plan_proposal schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 32: recipe name per slot and rationale (provider call as above); off=LLM
AG.&gt;AC : 33: PlanAttempt(proposal, toolCalls); off=AG
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;POR : 34: sizePortions(proposal, context); on=POR
POR-&gt;&gt;&gt;NS : 35: calculateNutrition(meals of each day); on=NS
NS.&gt;POR : 36: NutritionSummary; off=NS
POR-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS : 37: estimateCost(meals, pantry); on=BS
BS.&gt;POR : 38: CostEstimate; off=BS
POR.&gt;AC : 39: proposal with 1 or 2 servings per meal (closer to targets, within budget); off=POR
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV : 40: validate(proposal, context); on=PV
PV.&gt;AC : 41: ValidationResult (recipes, slots, meal types); off=PV
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 42: validatePlan(proposal, context); on=CV
text=CV:validateRestrictions(),\nvalidateTime(), variety
CV-&gt;&gt;&gt;NS : 43: calculateNutrition(meals); on=NS
NS.&gt;CV : 44: NutritionSummary; off=NS
CV-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS : 45: estimateCost(meals, pantry); on=BS
BS.&gt;CV : 46: CostEstimate; off=BS
CV.&gt;AC : 47: ValidationResult; off=CV
text=AC:violations are added to\nthe context for the retry
--=L
combinedFragment=alt~A GUI MPR; F:[proposal valid]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 48: createFromProposal(request, proposal); on=MPS
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPR : 49: save(plan)
MPS.&gt;AC : 50: MealPlan (ACTIVE, previous\nplan archived); off=MPS
AC.&gt;F : 51: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nplan, rationale, agentSteps)
..=A; F:[still invalid after 2 attempts]
AC.&gt;F : 52: AgentResponse(CONFLICT,\nviolations); off=AC
text=MPS:no plan is saved,\nthe reasons are listed
--=A
F.&gt;GUI : 53: AgentResponse; off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 54: "Plan saved" with day cards,\nor "No plan was saved" with details</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
